OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and damp start for
OL,6,Fmany places. Cloud slowly breaks and
OL,7,Frain turns patchy through the morning,
OL,8,Fwith many areas dry through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Mild with winds easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPartly cloudy and dry, skies
OL,12,Fwill clear in the east overnight
OL,13,Fallowing fog patches to develop by the
OL,14,Fmorning. Winds remain light.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FEarly morning fog patches
OL,17,Fwill lift and clear becoming partly
OL,18,Fcloudy during the morning. Some longer
OL,19,Fsunny intervals develop during the
OL,20,Fafternoon, especially along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
