OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud and sunny spells on Friday.
OL,7,FPotential for mist and fog patches
OL,8,Fovernight then clearing slowly.
OL,9,FCloudier on Saturday and Sunday. Winds
OL,10,Fbecoming light. Mild by day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
